基本上，我们——也就是设计团队——正在把所有改动、演示和想法直接做进这个界面里，这样我们就可以直接在上面测试和继续开发。这已经变成一个很棒的过程，一旦……
And basically we're building all of these—the design team is building all of these changes and demos and ideas right into the interface here so we can just test and build on top of it. And it's become this beautiful process where once...

